sequenceDiagram
    participant S as scheduler.py (JOBS)
    participant M as fetch_bdi/fao __main__()
    participant F as BdiFetcher / FaoFetcher
    participant Net as Stooq / FAO
    participant D as data/*.json

    S->>M: subprocess.Popen(fetch_bdi.py @0625 / fetch_fao.py @0925 dom=1)
    M->>F: run()
    F->>F: collect()
    alt BDI
        F->>Net: _solve_stooq_challenge() → GET CSV (带 cookie)
    else FAO
        F->>Net: _resolve_csv_url() → GET 版本化 CSV
    end
    Net-->>F: CSV text
    F->>F: 解析 → 组装 dict(status, 主信号, 子项)
    alt status == ok
        F->>D: save_json() 原子写盘(注入 _schema_version/updated)
        D-->>F: path
    else 失败 / 异常 / 校验非 CSV
        F->>F: run() 捕获 → 返回 None
        F->>D: load_previous_good() 保留上次良值(不覆盖)
        Note over F,D: 无良值则 save_json 写 status=unavailable(兜底)
    end
